{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>發佈時間：15:24 2026-09-22 HKT</p>\n\n<p>越秀地產發展的油塘擎海I今日首度開放示範單位予傳媒參觀，部署短期開價，首批料不少於125伙，將涵蓋1至3房間隔。</p>\n<img alt=\"油塘擎海I部署短期開價，首批料不少於125伙，將涵蓋1至3房間隔。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b48796af84b75b291810d1ba9aa8bc88/2026-09/PF260905YP09_1_.jpg\" title=\"油塘擎海I部署短期開價，首批料不少於125伙，將涵蓋1至3房間隔。\"/>\n<p>越秀地產(香港)總經理李嘎指出，項目自推出以來，吸引大量準買家查詢，客源多元，包括上車、換樓、分支家庭及專才等，當中不乏自用及投資客，故部署短期開價，首批不少於125伙，涉及1至3房戶。</p>\n<p>李嘎指出，香港首份《五年規劃》及《施政報告》公布後，本港產業發展目標明確，隨著產業多元化，將會有更多人才來港，料樓市的剛需會持續增加，市場上有大量新盤同時推出，反映發展商亦睇好後市發展，增強整體樓市信心。</p>\n<p>越秀地產（香港）銷售及市場營銷總監鍾顯騰介紹項目示範單位，交樓標準單位分別以5座28樓L室及3座28樓D室為藍本，屬1及2房設計；另以3座28樓D室為藍本的經改動示範單位，面積484方呎，屬2房連梗廚間隔。</p>\n<h2>5座28樓L室交樓標準示範單位：</h2>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f58a25a6df833da6b76211b8f2d07878/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-22_at_3_18_19_PM_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9db6819b6153f3e0a765043f69cfff99/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-22_at_3_18_20_PM.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d994fd545d18569961eace1d55ccf455/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-22_at_3_18_20_PM_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ddeb50d93ebc60597b8c8c3f97f1f312/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-22_at_3_18_21_PM.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ac0c7fad23e615a7ee50f7c972e487b9/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-22_at_3_18_20_PM_2_.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b3d87b01a2ef8149bc09adcf98e3e2ce/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-22_at_3_18_19_PM.jpeg\"/>\n<h2>3座28樓D室交樓標準示範單位：</h2>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5dbb46900b13b805b7ea0c11c169ff75/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-22_at_3_18_22_PM_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ea23c5add164479bb4fb4222b327d071/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-22_at_3_18_23_PM_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0ad211fee12786aaf5b84c283ccf5453/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-22_at_3_18_23_PM_2_.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9c51f1621c5079863f5ae225a50cb3f1/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-22_at_3_18_24_PM.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e7220c41ee8b0c9d45476af003f09fb3/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-22_at_3_18_22_PM.jpeg\"/>\n<h2>3座28樓D室經改動示範單位：</h2>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/2b14b5855cc9c294a609283687f50a19/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-22_at_3_18_16_PM.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f7f0e4ac5b50bb01227a7ecda335cdd0/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-22_at_3_18_17_PM.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/dc5933a3bc3cb4aad8331da3007ef237/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-22_at_3_18_17_PM_0.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1b8a22485747e0f6fca9a1efe5401a28/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-22_at_3_18_16_PM_0.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/530929d9cd29debd64f91f7907990a34/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-22_at_3_18_17_PM_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/29bcbd77fec43991b47c64ad0987403b/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-22_at_3_18_18_PM_2_.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/92f3aa95e6db34f4646acdf1ae2700c0/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-22_at_3_18_18_PM.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e4f951985c6941f475e92da3a0a8d91e/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-22_at_3_18_16_PM_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<p>相關文章： 油塘擎海I今上樓書涉617伙 主打1房及2房 料明日開示位</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-22T07:57:58.056607+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":469,"images":20,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}